Figger

This project ports ideas and designs from FigCraft (https://github.com/storytold/figcraft),
Copyright the ArtCraft team, licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0: the single command registry, the
persistent document model with structural sharing, instances materialised from their main
components with per-layer overrides, and layout as a pure function. No FigCraft source code
is copied; the implementation is written fresh in JavaScript.

src/shell.html (and the built index.html) inline the NakliOS SDK (sdk/naklios.js from
https://github.com/NakliTechie/nakliOS), MIT licence, between the naklios-sdk markers.

The number-field behaviours (drag to scrub, Shift for precision, Ctrl to snap, typed maths,
Backspace to reset) follow the behaviour of Blender's number fields as described by
ppmpreetham/BUI. No code from Blender or BUI (both GPL) is used.

Figger is a clean-room design tool. It uses no Figma assets, icons or proprietary format code.
